  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Home of the Red Fox** (1 review): The instrumental tune in the recording is Home of the Red Fox [3]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Dust in a Baggy**: rare: 10 archived performances [4]\n- **Rock the Cradle**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Willing to Gamble Again**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **Time for us to Wander**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Taking a Slow Train**: rare: 10 archived performances [4]\n- **Lay Down My Old Guitar**: rare: 6 archived performances [4]\n- **Blue as I Could Be**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **BillyStrings2017-07-14.CA14.Flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 13 songs; 73 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Source combines an afternoon Catskill Tent Stage set with the last few main stage tunes, where Cody Kilby of Travelin' McCourys sat in [1]\n- Cody Kilby guested on Me and My Uncle, and also on These Old Blues [2]\n- Lindsay Lou joined the band on Down Lonesome River [2]\n- The listing notes a Last Train to Clarksville tease during the show [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **BillyStrings2017-07-14.CA14.Flac16**: taped by Rich Stoler; transferred by Rich Stoler; source: Church Audio-14 Cardoid Mics -> Church Audio 9200 PreAmp -> TASCAM DR-100MKII @ 24-Bit/44.1 [1]",
